-- HALLOWEEN NPC OFFSET + CRATOS DODGE
--
-- Ordinary Hallowed mobs are farmed from BELOW (-8.5). Three exceptions, each
-- taking the value the matching mission quest already uses rather than a
-- guess, so the two agree:
--
--   Barbarit (any variant) -> the BOSS FARM's offset for it, read live from
--                             _0xa299._0x5ecb["Barbarit The Rose"].offset
--                             (12.5), which is also what this farm's own
--                             Barbarit boss-method already uses - so the two
--                             paths through the same farm now agree
--   The Hallowed Barbarian -> +9     (Boss Mission: bossOffsets. The Boss Farm
--                             has no entry for this one, so the mission quest
--                             is the only reference there is)
--   Hallowed Cratos        -> -7, and -10 further while it is spinning
--
-- Cratos spawns around a Pumpkin Point too, and it has a telegraphed spin that
-- has to be dodged. The Cratos mission quest keys that off animation
-- 6999923160 ("Cratos Spin") once the track passes 0.3s, dropping a further
-- -10 from its -7 base - mirrored here exactly.
