-- of each get the same treatment without listing them.
--
-- Deliberately NOT gated on Target Bosses Also. That toggle decides whether to
-- ATTACK these at all; once we are already fighting one, standing in the wrong
-- place is wrong either way. With the toggle off the old code fell through to
-- -8.5 and farmed the Barbarian from underneath.
