-- reads the game's own live data out of its Lua state: ~0.003 ms against
-- ~148 ms for a GetData round trip, with identical contents. That matters
-- because this polls. "Candy" is the item name the Halloween NPCs drop
-- (GameManager Items.Candy, Consumable, SalePrice 2) and the same string the
-- farm already picks up.
--
