---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- BOSS LOST vs STREAMED OUT
--
-- Teleporting to a far safespot makes the server stop replicating the boss to
-- us. The model is removed from our workspace WITHOUT the boss dying, which a
-- plain `boss.Parent == nil` / `IsDescendantOf(workspace)` test cannot tell
-- apart from a kill - so the farm decided the boss was defeated and jumped to
-- loot collection.
--
-- Remember where we last saw it alive; when it vanishes, pull that area back
-- in and try to re-acquire before concluding anything, with a grace window.
