    -- log caught "Sand CoffinVietKillerEZ" in Debris from another player, and
    -- a bare prefix match would have dodged someone else's cast on the far
    -- side of the map. The same log caught a "Sand Shield..." copy 8802 studs
    -- away with dY -606.
