                -- caught it arriving BEFORE the shield Model's ChildAdded:
                --
                --   SAND SHIELD spike tick (Sand ShieldGaara)
                --   KNOCKBACK power 80 / took 25
                --   SAND SHIELD ... via Debris        <- only now
                --
